PS5 HDMI: CEC (ps5-linux-patches #53 by Slip), ported to 7.3

HDMI CEC through the HDMI bridge: a CEC adapter (drivers/ps5/ps5-cec.c, the
CEC framework) that gets the bridge's CEC notifications (RX 0x05, TX result
0x06) via a handler hook in hdmi.c's notification handler, sends frames with
ICC commands, and turns TV remote keys into an input device. One-touch play
(turn the TV on and switch it to the console at boot) is on by default:
ps5-cec.one_touch_play=0 turns it off. Kconfig: X86_PS5 selects CEC_CORE.
Upstream file taken as is; only the hook in hdmi.c is placed in our handler.
---

